@startuml 端口适配器类图_推送
' 系统分析报告 3.2 端口与适配器类图（二）推送侧（PlantUML 类图）
' 渲染：java -jar plantuml.jar docs/uml/端口适配器类图_推送.puml -tpng -charset UTF-8
title 智能日报生成器 v2 · 推送端口与适配器

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #5A6B8C
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFF6DA
  BorderColor #5A6B8C
}
skinparam ArrowColor #5A6B8C

interface EmailPublisher <<Protocol · runtime_checkable>> {
  send_email(report, recipients) : SendResult
}
interface BotPublisher <<Protocol · runtime_checkable>> {
  push_to_feishu(report, webhook=None) : PushResult
}

class SmtpEmailPublisher <<适配器>>
class WebhookBotPublisher <<适配器>>
class FakePublisher <<测试替身 · fail_email=False, fail_bot=False>>

class SendResult {
  success : list[str]
  failed : list[tuple[str, str]]
  ok : bool «property»
}
class PushResult {
  ok : bool
  error : str | None
}

EmailPublisher <|.. SmtpEmailPublisher
EmailPublisher <|.. FakePublisher
BotPublisher <|.. WebhookBotPublisher
BotPublisher <|.. FakePublisher

EmailPublisher ..> SendResult : 返回
BotPublisher ..> PushResult : 返回

note right of FakePublisher
  同时实现两个端口，可注入渠道失败，
  供失败隔离用例使用。
end note
@enduml
